            "review_title": "Review at Hue Beef Noodle Soup 24H",
            "review_text": "must_travel_soon_10\nMississauga, Canada1779 contributions\n0\nExcellent noodle soup with offal cuts\nApr 2023\nThis place is open 24hrs and always a line up, for good reason. Excellent soup broth, noodles and offal cuts at a great price. Lots of outdoor tables/seating, but there are rats in these streets. Maybe take out is a good option.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 27, 2023",
